  "prefLabel": "Cor 101.30 Security threat group",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 101.30 “Security threat group” means a group of individuals possessing common characteristics that distinguish them from other groups and are a threat to staff, other inmates, the institution, or the community.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #12500, eff 3-23-18",
